itter":{"date":"2026-03-01T23:47:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/api example (#217)\n\n* feat(api): initialize NestJS API with basic structure and modules\n\n- Add package.json for project dependencies and scripts\n- Create main application module and entry point\n- Implement app controller with health check endpoint\n- Add app service for basic greeting functionality\n- Introduce logging interceptor for request/response logging\n- Define constants for application-wide usage\n- Set up TypeORM with PostgreSQL configuration\n- Create ''tipo'' module with controller, service, and entity\n- Implement findAll method in tipo service to retrieve data\n- Configure TypeScript settings with tsconfig.json\n\n* feat: add initial structure for static API with health check and environment services\n\n- Created index.html for the static API frontend.\n- Implemented AppReadinessService to manage application readiness state.\n- Developed DataSourceService for database connection management with support for multiple database types (Postgres, MySQL, SQL Server, SQLite).\n- Added EnvironmentService to handle environment variables.\n- Introduced HttpSourceService for managing external HTTP endpoints.\n- Implemented HealthController and HealthService for health check endpoints.\n- Created CustomDatabaseHealthIndicator to check database health.\n- Added VersionController to retrieve the current commit hash.\n- Implemented JWT authentication guard with session validation.\n- Added custom validation constraint for recent date checks.\n- Configured TypeScript with appropriate settings for building the project.\n\n* feat: add templates for NestJS API structure including modules, controllers, services, and DTOs\n\n* feat: atualizar caminhos dos templates para refletir a estrutura correta do projeto\n\n* Refactor: Remove deprecated services and controllers\n\n- Deleted datasource.service.ts, environment.module.ts, environment.service.ts, httpsource.service.ts, health.controller.ts, health.database.indicator.ts, health.module.ts, health.service.ts, jwt-auth.guard.module.ts, jwt-auth.guard.ts, constraint.isRecentDate.ts, version.controller.ts, and version.module.ts.\n- Recreated services and controllers in the new module structure under src/modules.\n- Introduced AppReadinessService to manage application readiness state.\n- Updated JwtAuthGuard to use new module paths.\n- Implemented health checks and version control endpoints in the new structure.\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:codex\n\n* fix:codex\n\n* fix:codex","tree":{"sha":"31607cf350999e7b52a86c27e67365f60dfc5973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Malnati/node-gen/git/trees/31607cf350999e7b52a86c27e67365f60dfc5973"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Malnati/node-gen/git/commits/6e794cab189949258feacc41cbda2f98ce81a582","verification":{"payload":"tree 31607cf350999e7b52a86c27e67365f60dfc5973\nparent 1e31a9ff4a558a35d2469c931c519fdd62f4fed1\nauthor Ricardo Malnati <35036961+Malnati@users.noreply.github.com> 1772408829 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772408829 -0300\n\nFeat/api example (#217)\n\n* feat(api): initialize NestJS API with basic structure and modules\n\n- Add package.json for project dependencies and scripts\n- Create main application module and entry point\n- Implement app controller with health check endpoint\n- Add app service for basic greeting functionality\n- Introduce logging interceptor for request/response logging\n- Define constants for application-wide usage\n- Set up TypeORM with PostgreSQL configuration\n- Create ''tipo'' module with controller, service, and entity\n- Implement findAll method in tipo service to retrieve data\n- Configure TypeScript settings with tsconfig.json\n\n* feat: add initial structure for static API with health check and environment services\n\n- Created index.html for the static API frontend.\n- Implemented AppReadinessService to manage application readiness state.\n- Developed DataSourceService for database connection management with support for multiple database types (Postgres, MySQL, SQL Server, SQLite).\n- Added EnvironmentService to handle environment variables.\n- Introduced HttpSourceService for managing external HTTP endpoints.\n- Implemented HealthController and HealthService for health check endpoints.\n- Created CustomDatabaseHealthIndicator to check database health.\n- Added VersionController to retrieve the current commit hash.\n- Implemented JWT authentication guard with session validation.\n- Added custom validation constraint for recent date checks.\n- Configured TypeScript with appropriate settings for building the project.\n\n* feat: add templates for NestJS API structure including modules, controllers, services, and DTOs\n\n* feat: atualizar caminhos dos templates para refletir a estrutura correta do projeto\n\n* Refactor: Remove deprecated services and controllers\n\n- Deleted datasource.service.ts, environment.module.ts, environment.service.ts, httpsource.service.ts, health.controller.ts, health.database.indicator.ts, health.module.ts, health.service.ts, jwt-auth.guard.module.ts, jwt-auth.guard.ts, constraint.isRecentDate.ts, version.controller.ts, and version.module.ts.\n- Recreated services and controllers in the new module structure under src/modules.\n- Introduced AppReadinessService to manage application readiness state.\n- Updated JwtAuthGuard to use new module paths.\n- Implemented health checks and version control endpoints in the new structure.\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:opencode\n\n* fix:codex\n\n* fix:codex\n\n* fix:codex","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJppM/9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuacQAIxq4Jzap591cKTOtlOyoO0q\nWCgcGGNVti/hhyoOx/1K+WGd4TXcqqvoi8HT1wx1NkHgPHxG5pPYu4lAl3XllFJu\njONi2RvC5jHn3HQR6xWiqoH5DAUAqeeeKgSR6fr2p+xNeGhMfUDmFaqPRhYJO+HX\n6dK0HqvfzmPhWxlsDE/3oRk5dXexLq+D