ata management.\n\nThese changes aim to improve the overall structure and usability of the database schemas, facilitating better integration and data handling across the application.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpmKykCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASNsQAHN+haqKaXdP8GFbnayNgUow\nnATq/nSAB+bExYLlxa37ZcK7MdfdWlrBl631UQDNKZLbBux0c2FHnYaXNjZRM+9u\nBIBlXj78tDNG0UltNy5638mSQjlbSrWlBbwl6x65IuAFv5PpuBeHImUmExXMkrSR\nYZGwKDHDSF+wc3fi0Vb/WuVPqk07LXiHY6jsNgR59FNcjPNSY16qnA6JUxMSLuj9\nIs46zwUT1Cg8PXXYrJD69e/K43TMIfqbTknLrbc3rr8LSbozBa8e5mo32V3DahfN\ns5u0dLpStsT2T7XHUuOSSQvQFsOq4Wy63v1mlINdjaeCw56FgUKyUrasbs32sIJy\nwyuSytHpkev3+kNOQqxgffy+nNURGmghcpSR0ded3b9xTVx36/ZWUS1uerlC6dUP\nINOhySa+YPvbXjqMun6NKakAwtADBSGq9C8nYfJ7iW1IqUyxDMVOT/HwMV24DWUC\nXHIZoqo+mIaSogOgb2yIXd8cV5ndNINkqhbQH/zIHYXXS5zXTBr4T87W5Eo513ie\n2nNikvr2Lgj/OzzW9k+OBtwYueFdhSCagYrzFTVpYztGyUEXltyh6mPfRoC8yEG9\n2fEOdiNTSlYyOwtrH/zG7K2H7nEdRLPdAOe0fqyWdhGRvq0XDBxorfZrWDhfEKBU\nj5Q/VYT/GVixkcirjnwe\n=91NW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-20T18:49:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web