ithub.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/git/trees/1d0db1b4eb3d902e8ed5e01ca3b889d1fbc8651e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/git/commits/9d0817cc611d95d5ddee3f421ada3221e81b204b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17495210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Khunkurisu","id":17495210,"login":"Khunkurisu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDk1MjEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commit/9d0817cc611d95d5ddee3f421ada3221e81b204b","node_id":"C_kwDOMh0vy9oAKDlkMDgxN2NjNjExZDk1ZDVkZGVlM2Y0MjFhZGEzMjIxZTgxYjIwNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commit/50ef592f51ec8a27ee74fdb963fe74280f8378ba","sha":"50ef592f51ec8a27ee74fdb963fe74280f8378ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/50ef592f51ec8a27ee74fdb963fe74280f8378ba"}],"sha":"9d0817cc611d95d5ddee3f421ada3221e81b204b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/9d0817cc611d95d5ddee3f421ada3221e81b204b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17495210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Khunkurisu","id":17495210,"login":"Khunkurisu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDk1MjEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/50ef592f51ec8a27ee74fdb963fe74280f8378ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:38:58Z","email":"creative.3d@live.com","name":"Khunkurisu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:38:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Release 3.1.0 (#953)\n\n* chore(manifest): increment version\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(effects): removed incorrect parent lookup from effect (#938)\n\n* fix(dialog): Made \"pick\" dialog default to having first element selected so that it correctly displays radio buttons on opening (#937)\n\nCo-authored-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix: weapon traits behavior do not apply properly #934 (#943)\n\n* fix: uses parent if weapon strike\n\n* fix: fixes issue where isDefaultAction checks itself instead of parent\n\n* fix: fixes issue where itemSource ignores embedded actions\n\n* fix: fixed issue where strikes can share an id\n\nWell theres technically a really really really low chance that this can cause a duplicate id, but the chance of that is much lower than previously.\n\n* chore: split comment in two\n\n* Revert \"chore: split comment in two\"\n\nThis reverts commit 7d62419370deaeedcda7be3cf0bb3f224559d337.\n\n* Revert \"fix: fixed issue where strikes can share an id\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6f587b5df6629da1b33fbf13abdaafa57ce4404e.\n\n* fix: fixes issue where wrong strike is used if multiple are on a character\n\n* chore: add automated testing framework (#913)\n\n* Added Quench and Playwright to package.json\n\n* Added initial Playwright setup\n\n* Started adding local docker build tools\n\n* feat: continued work on Docker build npm script\n\n* fix: throw error if signed license file does not exist\n\n* fix: Bad \"with-license\" command and open Dockerworld automatically\n\n* fix: Remove dead \"docker-build.js\" file\n\n* feat: Added docker up and docker down to global-setup and global-teardown\n\n* fix: increase Viewport size to 1080p\n\n* feat: Added functional \"System Loaded\" and \"Stormlight Starter Rules Present\" tests\n\n* Comment out \"game loaded\" console log statement\n\n* fix: Fixed viewport for major browsers configuration\n\n* feat: Started adding embedded actions test spec\n\n* chore: improved secrets protection and added hardware acceleration hooks to Chromium\n\n* fix: Made playwright tests functional without hardware acceleration\n\n* feat: Started adding character sheet test spec and helpers\n\n* fix: Removed validateActor which ran in an invalid context\n\n* fix: Force id and uuid in paramsFromHook to be serialized and accessible in Playwright\n\n* feat: Made functions to check actor resource/attributes/defenses\n\n* feat: Added meaningful update actions to character-sheet.spec.ts\n\n* feat: Started adding item helper as fixture\n\n* fix: Move createActor to fixture\n\n* feat: Started adding more meaningful testing to embedded-actions test\n\n* feat: Add html5 drag and drop helper\n\n* feat: Add drag-and-drop ancestry/culture/path test\n\n* chore: Move character-sheet test spec to more specific location\n\n* fix: Point to the correct github container registry\n\n* fix(docker): generalized docker-compose and dockerfile locations and world-seed location\n\n* fix: removed unused quench-entrypoint and quench-runner scripts\n\n* fix (docker): mount the foundry_license secret at the correct location\n\n* feat(docker): add a docker:signlicense command and a warning if a signed license doesn''t exist\n\n* feat(testing): Started adding character sheet actions tab tests\n\n* fix: moved all Docker related files to world-seed repo\n\n* feat: added link-world-seed script\n\n* fix (testing): removed enable-modules.mjs from system repo\n\n* feat (testing): update ActorSheetRef to a class\n\n* feat (testing): Create checkHasAction function on actor\n\n* feat (testing): Added clearNotifications function and made testing Aid functional\n\n* feat (testing): Made checkHasAction default to \"-\" for consume and resources\n\n* feat (testing): Added use-action test for all actions through \"dodge\" alphabetically\n\n* feat (testing): made itemSheetRef into a class\n\n* feat (testing): Use all actions except strike\n\n* fix (testing): Increase timeouts for tests to 1 minute and assertions to 10 seconds\n\n* fix (testing): removed unnecessary page.pause\n\n* feat (testing): Added \"get most recent chat message\" function and added check for chat messages after using actions\n\n* feat (testing): speed up by not forcing docker rebuild on docker:up\n\n* feat (testing): speed up by enabling HW acceleration when not running in a CI environment\n\n* feat (testing): add test to validate that weapon strike actions appear\n\n* feat (testing): character sheet strike action test now validates loaded property\n\n* chore (testing): Consolidated all initialization tests to one single test\n\n* fix (testing): renamed getLocatorForNextWindowToOpen for clarity\n\n* feat (testing): More thoroughly test resources on embedded actions\n\n* feat (testing): Added edit mode toggle on/off tests\n\n* fix (testing): validate axe is not visible when not equipped\n\n* feat (testing): Added adversary sheet actions test\n\n* fix (testing): made adversary edit mode test correctly target adversary sheet\n\n* chore: update manifest version\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* Refactor item/object translation strings into COSMERE.Objects.{Generic,Stormlight}; add configurable Imperial/Metric unit system setting (#810)\n\nCo-authored-by: TheCoder <ignacio@torakode.com>\nCo-authored-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat: adversary health resource configuration expansion #917 #408\n\n* fix: bug where hbs treats 0 as false\n\nI''m uncertain to what extent this changes things, but number fields in configuration forms could not be set to 0 because of this. Ideally no one used 0 as a false statement intentionally.\n\n* feat: adversary health range mode\n\nIncluding a slider for setting and modifying the range.\n\n* feat: adds buttons to roll and reset health\n\n* fix: fixes a few issues related to typing and range\n\n* feat: add mistborn starter rules (#35)\n\n* feat (mistborn starter rules): added new heading fonts (#7)\n\n* feat (mistborn starter rules): added new heading fonts\n\n* added boxing icon\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(fonts): remove duplicate penumbra sand std config\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(scripts): add unpack script\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(packs/ancestries): set up sub-directories for setting-content\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(packs/adversaries): set up sub-directories for setting-content\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(packs/companions): set up sub-directories for setting-content\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(packs/cultures): set up sub-directories for setting-cont