https://github.com/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commit/ab5dccba52a3640bc27a72a87caeaca650a1d52c","sha":"ab5dccba52a3640bc27a72a87caeaca650a1d52c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/ab5dccba52a3640bc27a72a87caeaca650a1d52c"}],"sha":"6ca7c8f20fb781b6fdb6e534f416109869e50454","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/6ca7c8f20fb781b6fdb6e534f416109869e50454"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17495210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Khunkurisu","id":17495210,"login":"Khunkurisu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDk1MjEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/ab5dccba52a3640bc27a72a87caeaca650a1d52c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T14:04:38Z","email":"creative.3d@live.com","name":"Khunkurisu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T14:04:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Release 3.0.2 (#927)\n\n* fix: update getters for skill test rolls and damage rolls to include skill mod bonuses (#907)\n\n* fix: updates getters for skill and damage roll data to include skill mod bonuses\n\n* fix: simplifies the code\n\n* fix: Fixes issue where chat displayed attribute is incorrect\n\n* fix(documents): add automatic assignment of _stats.createdTime for any retrieved document (#909)\n\n* chore: add automated testing framework (#913)\n\n* Added Quench and Playwright to package.json\n\n* Added initial Playwright setup\n\n* Started adding local docker build tools\n\n* feat: continued work on Docker build npm script\n\n* fix: throw error if signed license file does not exist\n\n* fix: Bad \"with-license\" command and open Dockerworld automatically\n\n* fix: Remove dead \"docker-build.js\" file\n\n* feat: Added docker up and docker down to global-setup and global-teardown\n\n* fix: increase Viewport size to 1080p\n\n* feat: Added functional \"System Loaded\" and \"Stormlight Starter Rules Present\" tests\n\n* Comment out \"game loaded\" console log statement\n\n* fix: Fixed viewport for major browsers configuration\n\n* feat: Started adding embedded actions test spec\n\n* chore: improved secrets protection and added hardware acceleration hooks to Chromium\n\n* fix: Made playwright tests functional without hardware acceleration\n\n* feat: Started adding character sheet test spec and helpers\n\n* fix: Removed validateActor which ran in an invalid context\n\n* fix: Force id and uuid in paramsFromHook to be serialized and accessible in Playwright\n\n* feat: Made functions to check actor resource/attributes/defenses\n\n* feat: Added meaningful update actions to character-sheet.spec.ts\n\n* feat: Started adding item helper as fixture\n\n* fix: Move createActor to fixture\n\n* feat: Started adding more meaningful testing to embedded-actions test\n\n* feat: Add html5 drag and drop helper\n\n* feat: Add drag-and-drop ancestry/culture/path test\n\n* chore: Move character-sheet test spec to more specific location\n\n* fix: Point to the correct github container registry\n\n* fix(docker): generalized docker-compose and dockerfile locations and world-seed location\n\n* fix: removed unused quench-entrypoint and quench-runner scripts\n\n* fix (docker): mount the foundry_license secret at the correct location\n\n* feat(docker): add a docker:signlicense command and a warning if a signed license doesn''t exist\n\n* feat(testing): Started adding character sheet actions tab tests\n\n* fix: moved all Docker related files to world-seed repo\n\n* feat: added link-world-seed script\n\n* fix (testing): removed enable-modules.mjs from system repo\n\n* feat (testing): update ActorSheetRef to a class\n\n* feat (testing): Create checkHasAction function on actor\n\n* feat (testing): Added clearNotifications function and made testing Aid functional\n\n* feat (testing): Made checkHasAction default to \"-\" for consume and resources\n\n* feat (testing): Added use-action test for all actions through \"dodge\" alphabetically\n\n* feat (testing): made itemSheetRef into a class\n\n* feat (testing): Use all actions except strike\n\n* fix (testing): Increase timeouts for tests to 1 minute and assertions to 10 seconds\n\n* fix (testing): removed unnecessary page.pause\n\n* feat (testing): Added \"get most recent chat message\" function and added check for chat messages after using actions\n\n* feat (testing): speed up by not forcing docker rebuild on docker:up\n\n* feat (testing): speed up by enabling HW acceleration when not running in a CI environment\n\n* feat (testing): add test to validate that weapon strike actions appear\n\n* feat (testing): character sheet strike action test now validates loaded property\n\n* chore (testing): Consolidated all initialization tests to one single test\n\n* fix (testing): renamed getLocatorForNextWindowToOpen for clarity\n\n* feat (testing): More thoroughly test resources on embedded actions\n\n* feat (testing): Added edit mode toggle on/off tests\n\n* fix (testing): validate axe is not visible when not equipped\n\n* feat (testing): Added adversary sheet actions test\n\n* fix (testing): made adversary edit mode test correctly target adversary sheet\n\n* chore: update manifest compatibility fields\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore: update manifest version\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(character sheets): notes collapse on rerender#627 (#914)\n\n* fix: fixes issue and cleans up notes section code\n\n* chore: updates relevant deprecated calls\n\n* chore: update comment\n\n* Clarify htmlField property comment\n\nUpdated comment to clarify the purpose of the htmlField property.\n\n* fix: modifies grabbing of item from uuid to function with compendiums (#905)\n\n* fix: removes unnecessary grabbing of item from uuid\n\n* feat: New Feature to get embedded items by uuid from items\n\n* chore: split a check for added clarity to console messages\n\n* feat(weapons): add strike skill test bonus and damage bonus fields (#911)\n\n* feat(weapons): add strike skill test bonus and damage bonus fields\n\n* chore: undo unrelated change\n\n* chore(weapon strikes): move skill test field and unify roll bonus localization\n\n* chore: add comment\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: dtfe <jonasaje@stud.ntnu.no>\n\n* chore (testing): Added PR pipeline to automatically run tests (#924)\n\n* feat (testing): Added Playwright PR pipeline job\n\n* chore (testing): include PR number in workflow name\n\n* chore (testing): fixed name vs run-name\n\n* chore (testing): Added build system step and install world-seed dependencies step\n\n* chore (testing): added line reporter in CI\n\n* chore (testing): only install chromium playwright browser on CI\n\n* chore (testing): dramatically increase timeouts, especially for CI, and only retry tests once\n\n* chore (testing): made clearing notifications faster and disabled audio startup\n\n* chore (testing): made pipeline add permissions to build folder (including compendiums)\n\n* chore (testing): tests default to no-canvas mode for better performance\n\n* chore (testing): Add junit reporter to CI config\n\n* chore (testing): switched to GitHub test reporter\n\n* chore (testing): resolved review comments\n\n* chore (testing): Corrected testDir location for new config directory\n\n* chore (testing): Moved test folder out of system\n\n* chore (testing): Split Playwright tests out to a reusable workflow and created a PR workflow which calls it\n\n* chore (testing): fix inherit secrets location\n\n* chore (testing): fix build dependency location\n\n* chore (testing): correctly checkout the system repo before running tests\n\n* chore (testing): added parameters and required secrets to system-test.yml\n\n* chore (testing): Moved lint into unified PR validation pipeline\n\n* chore (testing): Clarified naming of playwright system tests\n\n* chore (testing): fixed workflow dispatch for PR pipeline\n\n* chore (testing): Added utils.ts and moved clearNotifications to it\n\n* chore (testing): fixed reference to clearNotifications in fixtures\n\n* chore (testing): Added more actor helper functions\n\n* fix(rolls): constants are not properly calculated #915 (#916)\n\n* fix: removes recalculation of total and uses existing total.\n\n* fix: fixes issue where constant is applied twice.\n\n* fix: fixes function to get constant from roll by taking the total and removing the die results\n\n* fix: separate die roll modifiers from final bonus\n\n* chore: update package version to match manifest\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore: update node engine requirements\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore: update patch notes\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* Revert \"fix(rolls): constants are not properly calculated #915\" (#928)\n\n* Revert \"fix(rolls): constants are not properly calculated #915 (#916)\"\n\nThis reverts commit ab34362b999e7abffabf1a8d69e01811128d7a55.\n\n* chore: remove fix from patch notes\n\n* fix(damage rolls): adds checks to ensure skill and attribute exists (#930)\n\n* fix: adds checks to ensure skill and attribute exists\n\n* chore: adds check earlier as well and