posadist-revolution/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posadist-revolution/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/posadist-revolution","id":16562784,"login":"posadist-revolution","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTYyNzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posadist-revolution/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posadist-revolution/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posadist-revolution/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posadist-revolution/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posadist-revolution/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/posadist-revolution","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/f28fac8dda59a77838bcb21fd1b4b621daf4ab4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:21:24Z","email":"ihunickesmith@gmail.com","name":"posadist-revolution"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:21:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: Merge 2.2.0 into 3.0.0 (#829)\n\n* chore(manifest): update version\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat: expand linked-skills support to connection, equipment, loot, talent (#725)\n\n* feat(connection): support linked skills\n\nAjoute LinkedSkillsMixin au data model Connection pour permettre aux\ncontacts/relations sociales de fournir des linked skills au character\nqui les possede. Ajoute aussi l''onglet Details au ConnectionItemSheet\n(absent jusque-la) pour exposer la section linked-skills dans l''UI.\nSans cet onglet, le mixin ne disposerait d''aucune surface UI et serait\nconfigurable uniquement via API.\n\nRefs #404\n\n* feat(equipment): support linked skills\n\nAjoute LinkedSkillsMixin au data model Equipment. Les equipements\nutilitaires (sac, lampe, corde, etc.) peuvent maintenant fournir des\nlinked skills au character qui les possede. Pas de changement template\nni de sheet (utilise item-details-tab.hbs partage qui invoque deja\nle composant, et l''onglet Details est deja declare dans\nEquipmentItemSheet).\n\nRefs #404\n\n* feat(loot): support linked skills\n\nAjoute LinkedSkillsMixin au data model Loot, et invoque le composant\napp-item-details-linked-skills dans loot-details-tab.hbs (template\ncustom qui n''utilise pas item-details-tab.hbs partage). Permet aux\nitems de butin de fournir des linked skills au character possesseur.\n\nRefs #404\n\n* feat(talent): support linked skills\n\nAjoute LinkedSkillsMixin au data model Talent, et invoque le composant\napp-item-details-linked-skills dans talent-details-tab.hbs. Un Talent\npeut maintenant declarer ses propres linked skills.\n\nNote: pour un PathTalent dont le Path parent fournit deja des linked\nskills, le GM peut configurer des skills supplementaires sur le\ntalent. La meme skill peut alors apparaitre liee a plusieurs items\ndans la fiche actor. C''est intentionnel et opt-in (defaut: liste vide).\n\nRefs #404\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Guillaume MIRANDA <guillaume.miranda@consulting-for.edenred.com>\n\n* Feat: Create Effects Container Document (#761)\n\n* feat(effects): add initial effects container item document setup\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): add getters for effect lists based on type\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): add isInContainer getter to CosmereActiveEffect class\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): add getters for effects list filtered by type\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(effects): refactor effect list type to enum\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects) add filter by state helper to actor effects list\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(sheets): register effects container sheet\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore: remove unused favorites content\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(actor sheets): preserve scroll position on render\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): initial effects-list refactor\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(templates): use new TEMPLATES.DIRECTORY where possible\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(actor sheets): simplify scrollable field of content part\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(package.json): adjust engine to accept foundry13-supported node versions\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(data models): introduce DataSchema generic to simplify schema processing for type checker\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(item lists): reduce repeated actions by merging in super.ACTIONS\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(styling): restore list item separation borders\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): support styling and functionality from generic item list\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(effects list): add expand state indicator to parent items\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(effects list): move state toggle action to correct element\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(effects): sort by lowercase name\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* Feat/Event triggers for combat Start/End & Round Start/End (#766)\n\n* Included events for Combat Start/End & Round Start/End\n\nCombat Start/End uses Foundry''s built in hooks, combatStart and deleteCombat.\nRound Start/End uses Custom hooks called combatRoundStart and combatRoundEnd\n\n* chore: Reorganized import\n\n* Cleaned up remnants of old code and unnecessary code\n\n* Updated event hooks to directly use foundry hooks\n\n* Fixed hooks by making use of options param for data\n\n* fix: forgot to remove this after removing an unnecessary file\n\n* fix: Moved round_end before super.nextRound and reduced params to only the current round.\n\n* fix: added round_start hook call on combat start\n\n* feat: added new event trigger for previous round\n\n* chore: changed some wording for consistency and clarity\n\n* Re-triggering Actions\n\n* fix: Re-fixed displaying nested effects\n\n* fix: Expand/collapse effect container details works again\n\n* fix: embedded items with combat events now trigger\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\nCo-authored-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\nCo-authored-by: mirandaguillaume <guillaume11miranda@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Guillaume MIRANDA <guillaume.miranda@consulting-for.edenred.com>\nCo-authored-by: dtfe <113169217+dtfe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dtfe <jonasaje@stud.ntnu.no>","tree":{"sha":"8350b1bde2abfd8ad3b668f91645db9eeb852abd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/git/trees/8350b1bde2abfd8ad3b668f91645db9eeb852abd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/git/commits/f28fac8dda59a77838bcb21fd1b4b621daf4ab4d","verification":{"payload":"tree 8350b1bde2abfd8ad3b668f91645db9eeb852abd\nparent 7cd402a884a495bdb3f75a41de4b59adbea8cc15\nauthor posadist-revolution <ihunickesmith@gmail.com> 1783966884 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783966884 -0600\n\nchore: Merge 2.2.0 into 3.0.0 (#829)\n\n* chore(manifest): update version\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat: expand linked-skills support to connection, equipment, loot, talent (#725)\n\n* feat(connection): support linked skills\n\nAjoute LinkedSkillsMixin au data model Connection pour permettre aux\ncontacts/relations sociales de fournir des linked skills au character\nqui les possede. Ajoute aussi l''onglet Details au ConnectionItemSheet\n(absent jusque-la) pour exposer la section linked-skills dans l''UI.\nSans cet onglet, le mixin ne disposerait d''aucune surface UI et serait\nconfigurable uniquement via API.\n\nRefs #404\n\n* feat(equipment): support linked skills\n\nAjoute LinkedSkillsMixin au data model Equipment. Les equipements\nutilitaires (sac, lampe, corde, etc.) peuvent maintenant fournir des\nlinked skills au character qui les possede. Pas de changement template\nni de sheet (utilise item-details-tab.hbs partage qui invoque deja\nle composant, et l''onglet Details est deja declare dans\nEquipmentItemSheet).\n\nRefs #404\n\n* feat(loot): support linked skills\n\nAjoute LinkedSkillsMixin au data model Loot, et invoque le composant\napp-item-details-linked-skills dans loot-details-tab.hbs (template\ncustom qui n''utilise pas item-details-tab.hbs partage). Permet aux\nitems de butin de fournir des linked skills au character possesseur.\n\nRefs #404\n\n* feat(talent): support linked skills\n\nAjoute LinkedSkillsMixin au data model Talent, et invoque le composant\napp-item-details-linked-skills dans talent-details-tab.hbs. Un Talent\npeut maintenant declarer ses propres linked skills.\n\nNote: pour un PathTalent dont le Path parent fournit deja des linked\nskills, le GM peut configurer des skills supplementaires sur le\ntalent. La meme skill peut alors apparaitre liee a plusieurs items\ndans la fiche actor. C''est intentionnel et opt-in (defaut: liste vide).\n\nRefs #404\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Guillaume MIRANDA <guillaume.miranda@consulting-for.edenred.com>\n\n* Feat: Create Effects Container Document (#761)\n\n* feat(effects): add initial effects container item document setup\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): add getters for effect lists based on type\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): add isInContainer getter to CosmereActiveEffect class\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): add getters for effects list filtered by type\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(effects): refactor effect list type to enum\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects) add filter by state helper to actor effects list\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(sheets): register effects container sheet\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore: remove unused favorites content\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(actor sheets): preserve scroll position on render\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): initial effects-list refactor\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(templates): use new TEMPLATES.DIRECTORY where possible\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(actor sheets): simplify scrollable field of content part\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(package.json): adjust engine to accept foundry13-supported node versions\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(data models): introduce DataSchema generic to simplify schema processing for type checker\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(item lists): reduce repeated actions by merging in super.ACTIONS\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(styling): restore list item separation borders\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(effects): support styling and functionality from generic item list\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(effects list): add expand state indicator to parent items\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(effects list): move state toggle action to correct element\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* fix(effects): sort by lowercase name\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu 