3c1a41413f57ee66fc55046589b","sha":"8a408356f6f313c1a41413f57ee66fc55046589b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/8a408356f6f313c1a41413f57ee66fc55046589b"}],"sha":"5e9f0d8fad5a4de271167514248b72e0b1b89d17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/5e9f0d8fad5a4de271167514248b72e0b1b89d17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17495210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Khunkurisu","id":17495210,"login":"Khunkurisu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDk1MjEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khunkurisu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/commits/efc593caa07392550d95b00bc1cae0b6913dfb93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T17:07:55Z","email":"creative.3d@live.com","name":"Khunkurisu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T17:07:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Release 2.1.0\n\n* chore(manifest): update version\n\n* fix(style): fix issue causing character sheet scrolling to be blocked in perf mode low (#615)\n\n* chore(manifest): update version\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* Feat: Add Disable Toggle to Events (#664)\n\n* fix(events): resolve typo in eventTypesByHook variable name, was missing the first t\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): define new boolean field ''disabled'', which defaults to false\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): filter out disabled rules when executing item events\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): add toggle to event rules list on each event\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(events): minor refactor of rule execution call and arguments\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): implement helper functions on item for toggling events\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(items): use proper paths in imports\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): add filterable toggle state modification function\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): remove label from toggle column and shrink column width\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* Fixes bug by making the maximum index the last index (#685)\n\nCo-authored-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\nCo-authored-by: zithith <55356181+zithith@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add carry/lift encumbrance UI and dialogs (#649)\n\n* Add carry/lift encumbrance UI and dialogs\n\nIntroduce Carry and Lift derived stats to actor sheets: add SVG assets (border_stat_long, mask_stat_long), update SCSS (new variables & long-stat layout), and extend actor details template to show Carry and Lift with configure actions. Add Handlebars dialog templates and TypeScript ApplicationV2 dialog classes for configuring carry and lift limits, register their template keys in TEMPLATES, and wire the actions in the actor details component.\n\n* Changing names to fit the official sheet\n\nCarry limit -> Carry Capacity\nLift limit -> Lifting Capacity\n\n* Unfinished weight section to equipment list\n\n* Column layout for weight, scss cleanup, removed carry stat from left column\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: zithith <55356181+zithith@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Resizeable character sheet (#690)\n\n* Removes hardcoded character sheet size and makes it resizeable\n\nWidth is locked\nHeight can be anywhere from 728px to 900 px, which 900 was the existing default.\n\n* Moved comment one line up\n\n* Improved prototype token default settings (#630)\n\n* Improved prototype token defaults and changes prototype token dimensions on actor.system.size changes\n\n* Added senses autogeneration to prototype token and put prototype changes behind sheet.autosetPrototypeTokenValues flag\n\n* Addressed review comments in actor code\n\n* Renamed isNumMax handlebars helper\n\n* Added settings for default token bar1 and bar2\n\n* Added settings to enable/disable all token automations by default for new actors\n\n* Better system for getting token size from actor size and no longer overwrites values passed in through actor CreateData\n\n* Made none an option for default token bar settings\n\n* Performance improvement by switching forEach loops to for...of loops\n\n* Addressed several review comments\n\n* Fixed config resources having wrong keys\n\n* Made token resource default setting respect CONFIG.COSMERE.resources\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* Fix: resolve improper styling for edit-event-rule dialog (#714)\n\n* fix: grant items box scroll\n\n* fix: correct min-height for event rule form groups\n\n* fix: check and create range object if should exist (#706)\n\n* Feat: Make Action and Equipment Sections on Actor Sheets Collapsible (#628)\n\n* Made action and equipment sections on actor sheets collapsible\n\n* Add configurable setting for section expansion default\n\n* Unified common code in action-list.ts and equipment-list.ts in new item-list.ts file\n\n* Removed unused imports\n\n* Moved more shared interfaces to item-list.ts\n\n* Fixed missing expand sections by default setting check\n\n* Fixed naming issue with SETTINGS.expandSectionsByDefault\n\n* Swapped to chevron-based expand/collapse display\n\n* Removed old equipment collapse button and made entire details element expand/collapse section\n\n* Fixed styling regression\n\n* Fixes inconsistent setting check\n\n* Fixed border-radius styling regression and made empty sections non-collapsible\n\n* Resolved review comments\n\n* fix: Made Adversary Action/Equipment sections correctly determine empty property (#716)\n\n* chore: update release notes\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore: add missing patch note for #705\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\nCo-authored-by: Stan <stanvdbroekk@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: stanavdb <142786862+stanavdb@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Zithith <jonnyt.jet@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: dtfe <113169217+dtfe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: zithith <55356181+zithith@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: posadist-revolution <ihunickesmith@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Boxfriend <boxfriend@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e1fed44ee75402aaf1a8d4feaeffb3125c09c92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/git/trees/5e1fed44ee75402aaf1a8d4feaeffb3125c09c92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-metalworks/cosmere-rpg/git/commits/efc593caa07392550d95b00bc1cae0b6913dfb93","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e1fed44ee75402aaf1a8d4feaeffb3125c09c92\nparent bb2792fdc7fc3ee3dadb16b847e9b843c6c3c471\nauthor Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com> 1778864875 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778864875 -0500\n\nRelease 2.1.0\n\n* chore(manifest): update version\n\n* fix(style): fix issue causing character sheet scrolling to be blocked in perf mode low (#615)\n\n* chore(manifest): update version\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* Feat: Add Disable Toggle to Events (#664)\n\n* fix(events): resolve typo in eventTypesByHook variable name, was missing the first t\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): define new boolean field ''disabled'', which defaults to false\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): filter out disabled rules when executing item events\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): add toggle to event rules list on each event\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(events): minor refactor of rule execution call and arguments\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): implement helper functions on item for toggling events\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore(items): use proper paths in imports\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): add filterable toggle state modification function\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* feat(events): remove label from toggle column and shrink column width\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* Fixes bug by making the maximum index the last index (#685)\n\nCo-authored-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\nCo-authored-by: zithith <55356181+zithith@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add carry/lift encumbrance UI and dialogs (#649)\n\n* Add carry/lift encumbrance UI and dialogs\n\nIntroduce Carry and Lift derived stats to actor sheets: add SVG assets (border_stat_long, mask_stat_long), update SCSS (new variables & long-stat layout), and extend actor details template to show Carry and Lift with configure actions. Add Handlebars dialog templates and TypeScript ApplicationV2 dialog classes for configuring carry and lift limits, register their template keys in TEMPLATES, and wire the actions in the actor details component.\n\n* Changing names to fit the official sheet\n\nCarry limit -> Carry Capacity\nLift limit -> Lifting Capacity\n\n* Unfinished weight section to equipment list\n\n* Column layout for weight, scss cleanup, removed carry stat from left column\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: zithith <55356181+zithith@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Resizeable character sheet (#690)\n\n* Removes hardcoded character sheet size and makes it resizeable\n\nWidth is locked\nHeight can be anywhere from 728px to 900 px, which 900 was the existing default.\n\n* Moved comment one line up\n\n* Improved prototype token default settings (#630)\n\n* Improved prototype token defaults and changes prototype token dimensions on actor.system.size changes\n\n* Added senses autogeneration to prototype token and put prototype changes behind sheet.autosetPrototypeTokenValues flag\n\n* Addressed review comments in actor code\n\n* Renamed isNumMax handlebars helper\n\n* Added settings for default token bar1 and bar2\n\n* Added settings to enable/disable all token automations by default for new actors\n\n* Better system for getting token size from actor size and no longer overwrites values passed in through actor CreateData\n\n* Made none an option for default token bar settings\n\n* Performance improvement by switching forEach loops to for...of loops\n\n* Addressed several review comments\n\n* Fixed config resources having wrong keys\n\n* Made token resource default setting respect CONFIG.COSMERE.resources\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* Fix: resolve improper styling for edit-event-rule dialog (#714)\n\n* fix: grant items box scroll\n\n* fix: correct min-height for event rule form groups\n\n* fix: check and create range object if should exist (#706)\n\n* Feat: Make Action and Equipment Sections on Actor Sheets Collapsible (#628)\n\n* Made action and equipment sections on actor sheets collapsible\n\n* Add configurable setting for section expansion default\n\n* Unified common code in action-list.ts and equipment-list.ts in new item-list.ts file\n\n* Removed unused imports\n\n* Moved more shared interfaces to item-list.ts\n\n* Fixed missing expand sections by default setting check\n\n* Fixed naming issue with SETTINGS.expandSectionsByDefault\n\n* Swapped to chevron-based expand/collapse display\n\n* Removed old equipment collapse button and made entire details element expand/collapse section\n\n* Fixed styling regression\n\n* Fixes inconsistent setting check\n\n* Fixed border-radius styling regression and made empty sections non-collapsible\n\n* Resolved review comments\n\n* fix: Made Adversary Action/Equipment sections correctly determine empty property (#716)\n\n* chore: update release notes\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n* chore: add missing patch note for #705\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Khunkurisu <creative.3d@live.com>\nCo-authored-by: Stan <stanvdbroekk@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: stanavdb <142786862+stanavdb@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Zithith <jonnyt.jet@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: dtfe <113169217+dtfe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: zithith <55356181+zithith@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: posadist-revolution <ihunickesmith@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Boxfriend <boxfriend@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqB1LrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/RcQAI1b23pkxutay9+fgnEBml4P\n/B36nMF9vZWjVpaqRvdLPtUyTdgJPScR3Zh2L/5eYNPmA4HC3wnDaRZIK7jnltvt\nh8JDW44QDz0caQtj3cs2svGmpWO0ctlBCYcHWu1pC0ToG1XaHnVrrnfmeLa9TeSf\nCgOTw0tSnp/XT7HWcTHu7JjFlBSXHm0CwAW2of0C+iY5iRDRl2KFZ1lmPyg/GBsG\nDGZvNc4AuRhTnOvW5KzNwJS3v7u1r2ege3DAnwSnCRmExtrjw7QBM/Uahhxl6zx2\nHAQCQXAxkd/XcC9m0NSnwT0G5ftovWE93Qhn/+okUE7yr5v1qw9vwPjzYDFLY+Gh\nMqC40kiiWMexbmxHLHjkGGDITEZO8H9VuXmDkfDuyXpbarFYeQwJII9YagM7gNwt\naELw86TPu5iKCIIGIabqaFnR86gX3lLPpl1rL0WwPqVVO58TgrOVCviAMQ2Ct/7g\nC6oHqj9Jbs+fVaEES3YcYo/yDsQN2YxjXdY2CR/z2ihPahDApCVd