ts/399a2e4bf1e3630d9a780c2ab8883dd11e03bd11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:13:08Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:13:08Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"message":"docs: rewrite README + CLAUDE.md for 0.3.x; bump to 0.3.2\n\nThe 0.3.1 README on npm was the pre-redesign 0.1.x content — referenced\npost-robot, the flat apna.nostr.fetchFeed/publishNote/getActiveUserProfile\nsurface, and the old { methodHandlers: { nostr: { … } } } host shape. All\ngone in 0.3.x.\n\nREADME rewrite covers:\n- All four entry points (., /react, /ui, /server) + per-entry size budgets\n- Mini-app usage with the new versioned domain modules\n  (apna.identity.v1, apna.social.v1, apna.nostr.*)\n- Permission gate model (open vs gated; once/session/always scopes)\n- Host registration via flat CapabilityHandlers + the IframeChannel + the\n  per-instance ApnaHost pattern\n- @apna/sdk/server NIP-98 backend flow + security note on publisher keys\n- Module Federation design-component customization via @apna/sdk/ui\n- Full 0.1.x → 0.3.x migration table for the 16 retired flat methods\n\nCLAUDE.md: ports the agent-facing layout doc to the new src/ tree\n(core/channels/bridge/transport, protocols/, domains/, permissions/,\nui/, server/) and removes the post-robot / INostr references.\n\nThis is a docs-only republish — no code or wire-protocol changes vs 0.3.1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4eb5a4e419cc5d71f723b4c5789a381ab1c2a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/sdk/git/trees/d4eb5a4e419cc5d71f723b4c5789a381ab1c2a24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/sdk/git/commits/399a2e4bf1e3630d9a780c2ab8883dd11e03bd11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"http