"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/sdk/commits/0354d5c75676391051d07197199ee28cbe1b7e3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T08:53:00Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T08:53:00Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"message":"redesign: SDK + host capability bridge, versioned domains, server + ui entries\n\nTwo-layer, two-topology, versioned capability bridge replacing the old\npost-robot RPC core. Drops `@apna/sdk` from 0.1.40 to 0.3.0 (breaking).\n\nTransport\n- core/protocol.ts — message envelopes, gating, discriminated union, type guards\n- core/channels/ — Channel interface + pluggable IframeChannel + ExtensionChannel\n  (per-instance, no module globals; iframe channel supports autoBind for the\n  legacy single-host path and source-filtered isolation for parallel instances)\n- core/bridge.ts — request/response correlation, handshake, stream() primitive\n  for bridge-only subscriptions, BridgeError + PermissionDeniedError mapping\n- core/http.ts + core/transport.ts — optional HTTP read client with in-flight\n  dedup + transport router that picks HTTP vs bridge per capability gating\n- client/ + host/ — ApnaApp + per-instance ApnaHost rewired onto the new\n  bridge; legacy `{ nostr: {...} }` host-shape adapter kept as a temporary shim\n- post-robot + @types/post-robot removed; core CJS/ESM bundle 9.25/9.31 KB\n  (under the 10 KB budget)\n\nVersioned contracts + domains\n- interfaces/ — Nostr/identity/social v1, UI, notifications, permissions,\n  CapabilityHandlers (host registry type)\n- protocols/ — apna.nostr low-level module; bitcoin/ethereum stubs that throw\n  \"<ns> not supported by this host\" until a host advertises them\n- domains/ — apna.identity.v1 + apna.social.v1 composed from apna.nostr; a\n  pickVersion helper exposes the latest negotiated version while keeping the\n  explicit .v1 pin addressable\n- domains/compat.ts removed (was the temporary 14-flat-method shim; MIG-002\n  finished migrating all known consumers)\n- interfaces/nostr/index.ts (legacy INostr) removed\n\nPermissions\n- permissions/ — apna.permissions.request / query / revoke + typed\n  PermissionDeniedError on permission-denied rpc errors\n\nUI entry (@apna/sdk/ui)\n- ui/federation.ts — Module Federation runtime helpers (init / register / load)\n- ui/with-dynamic-component.tsx — withDynamicComponent + setCustomiseHighlight\n- ui/host-components.tsx — useHostComponent / HostComponent loader from the\n  negotiated designRemote\n- @module-federation/enhanced added as a sub-entry dependency; MF runtime\n  weight stays out of the core `.` bundle\n\nServer entry (@apna/sdk/server)\n- server/ — createApnaServer({ signer, httpEndpoint }) for mini-app backends.\n  NIP-98-signed POSTs, no window/channel imports, no crypto dep (caller brings\n  a ServerSigner). Size 580 B under a 5 KB budget.\n\nPackage\n- export map: . / ./react / ./server / ./ui\n- per-entry size-limit budgets\n- react / react-dom moved to optional peerDependencies\n- version 0.1.40 → 0.3.0 (breaking — post-robot gone, INostr removed)\n\nTests\n- test/bridge.test.ts, test/channels.test.ts, test/transport.test.ts —\n  24 tests covering channel cross-talk isolation, RPC correlation, timeout +\n  dispose semantics, transport routing, handshake match/mismatch, bridge\n  streaming. Full suite green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8bf27d15096b7487fcf7d3bd9c1e559a13869d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/sdk/git/trees/8bf27d15096b7487fcf7d3bd9c1e559a13869d62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/sdk/git/commits/0354d5c75676391051d07197199ee28cbe1b7e3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/sdk/commit/0354d5c75676391051d07197199ee28cbe1b7e3a","node_id":"C_kwDOMin6H9oAKDAzNTRkNWM3NTY3NjM5MTA1MWQwNzE5NzE5OWVlMjhjYmUxYjdlM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"htt